  "methodology": "Three variants: upstream jws+jwa, vjws at adc9cb4 (before), and vjws+vjwa. Twelve rounds use all six variant orders twice. Pilot targets 10 ms blocks; sync 16–100000 iterations and async 1–100000. Warmup: 128 sync/2 async calls plus five full blocks for every variant, cycling variant order. Each result validated before timing. Outputs retained/consumed. Stream calls include source creation, collection and signing. Key import excluded for KeyObject cases, included for PEM cases; string PEM cache warm, PEM Buffer uncached. Three fresh-process reports per runtime and one identical-upstream calibration. No trimming. Units: nanoseconds per operation.",
